// Sum of kept winning labeled hammings equal to a central value.
// A single kept pair adds that hamming once.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hceq ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hceq rank

IMPULSE hceq 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hceq" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
